# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QiskitIBMRuntime.jl` runs one circuit per Sampler job, so collecting the data requires 1,024 jobs. The following cell keeps up to 32 jobs in the queue and saves the outcomes of each setting as soon as its job finishes. Each shot is returned as a vector of bits, in which element $i$ is the outcome of chain qubit $i$.\n"
msgstr "Ang `QiskitIBMRuntime.jl` ay nagpapatakbo ng isang circuit kada Sampler job, kaya ang pagkolekta ng data ay nangangailangan ng 1,024 na job. Ang sumusunod na cell ay nagpapanatili ng hanggang 32 job sa queue at sine-save ang mga resulta ng bawat setting sa sandaling matapos ang job nito. Ang bawat shot ay ibinabalik bilang vector ng mga bit, kung saan ang elementong $i$ ay ang resulta ng chain qubit na $i$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You must retrieve the results in the same session that submitted the jobs, because `QiskitIBMRuntime.jl` cannot yet look up a job by its ID ([qiskit-ibm-runtime-c issue #28](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime-c/issues/28)). If a job fails, the cell issues a warning and continues. If the session stops, run Steps 1 through 3 again. Rerunning the cell submits only the settings whose outcomes are missing. With `use_saved_data = true`, the cell submits nothing.\n"
msgstr "Kailangan mong kunin ang mga resulta sa parehong session na nag-submit ng mga job, dahil hindi pa kayang maghanap ng job gamit ang ID nito ng `QiskitIBMRuntime.jl` ([qiskit-ibm-runtime-c issue #28](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime-c/issues/28)). Kung pumalya ang isang job, mag-iisyu ng babala ang cell at magpapatuloy. Kung huminto ang session, patakbuhin muli ang Steps 1 hanggang 3. Ang muling pagpapatakbo ng cell ay magsa-submit lamang ng mga setting na kulang ang resulta. Kapag `use_saved_data = true`, walang isinusumite ang cell.\n"

